# PNG->MAG mapping table (consumed by build_game.py convert_png_to_mag).
# Format: <png_rel_path>  <mag_rel_path>  [options]
#   png_rel_path: source under assets/<game>/ (any PIL-readable format: PNG/JPG)
#   mag_rel_path: output under projects/<game>/ (MAG basename <= 8 chars, 8.3 rule)
# Rebuild is incremental: re-converts when the source is newer or options change.
# Options:
#   --256color      quantize to the 256-color shared palette (default marker)
#   --sprite        character sprite: reserve palette idx 15 as transparent,
#                   keep index 15 out of quantization (uses PROTECTED_IDX_NO15)
#   --cover         scale to FILL 640x400 keeping aspect, center-crop overflow
#                   (no bars). Default without it is contain: fit inside and
#                   center-paste with bars. Backgrounds/CGs that must fill the
#                   screen need this flag.
#   --dither        Floyd-Steinberg dithering during quantization
#   --no-resize     skip auto-resize to 640x400 (keep source pixels as-is)
#   --filter-white  map near-white pixels to palette white before quantization

png/bg/comlogo.png       images/comlogo.MAG   --256color
png/bg/mainmenu.png       images/mainmenu.MAG   --256color
png/char/fei-normal.png       images/fei-normal.MAG   --256color --sprite
png/char/fei-sad.png       images/fei-sad.MAG   --256color --sprite
png/char/fei-smile.png       images/fei-smile.MAG   --256color --sprite
png/char/fei-surprised.png       images/fei-surprised.MAG   --256color --sprite
png/char/fei-swimming.png       images/fei-swimming.MAG   --256color --sprite
png/char/ira-normal.png       images/ira-normal.MAG   --256color --sprite
png/char/ira-sad.png       images/ira-sad.MAG   --256color --sprite
png/char/neon-normal.png       images/neon-normal.MAG   --256color --sprite
png/bg/bg-beach1.jpg       images/beach1.MAG   --256color --cover
png/bg/bg-home-day.jpg       images/homeday.MAG   --256color --cover
png/bg/bg-home-night.jpg       images/homenite.MAG   --256color --cover
png/cg/cg01.png       images/cg01.MAG   --256color --cover
